{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あっっという間に3月ですね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう最近は、勝手ながら夏を感じています☀️\nちょっと気が早いですかね、？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とは言ってますが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実はこの前は暖かい服を着て撮影してきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☆3月4日発売の「週刊少年マガジン」14号\n表紙・巻頭グラビアに掲載していただいています！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "週刊少年マガジンさん初登場です！\n嬉しい、、、ありがとうございます😆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影先は、江ノ島〜✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobD93rVi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて行ったのですが、とにかく楽しかった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "春を通り越して夏気分の私と、\nしっかり冬をまとっている私。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は風が強くて寒かったんです☃️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobKMk34A.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "風に煽られながらも、\nたこせんとか食べちゃってにこにこ🐙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobfBGJEA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海のきらきらも、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "坂道のわくわくも、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだか青春を感じました！！☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また江ノ島行きたいな〜、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影してからずっと言ってる笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobQqsyK1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobIiVld0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上京してきて約1年。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京で迎える春に、こんな景色を見られていることが、なんだか不思議で嬉しかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自然な今の私がぎゅっと詰まっていると思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひチェックしていただけたら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "感想も待ってますね💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}